Asset notice

The in-game backdrops under `public/assets/sprites/original/` are
excerpts from the 1993 Warlords II floppy distribution by Strategic
Simulations, Inc. (SSG), with art and music by Steve Fawkner. They are
used under fair use as critical commentary and reconstruction reference
for this fan-made clone. All rights to the original artwork remain with
SSG and its successors. See `docs/asset-credits.md` for the full
provenance of every asset.
